            {
                "comment": "One of the most engaged and supportive professors I've ever had. It's clear that she cares about her students - both their success and their deep engagement with the texts. Her classes were fun and engaging. The texts were difficult and she always led from a place of understanding basics first before digging in, which was refreshing and helpful.",
