            {
                "comment": "Dr.Cannell is one of the best professors you will ever have. I have take two classes with her, and both were incredible. Her classes are big on implementing different feminist theories, but she finds really fun ways to teach theory in a way that is approachable. I would literally take any class taught by her.",
